$ tool help
usage: tool <command> [options]

commands:
  greet    print a greeting
  count    count lines, words and characters
  sum      sum the numbers given with -x
$ tool greet
hello, world!
$ tool greet --name Kotlin -t 2
hello, Kotlin!
hello, Kotlin!
$ tool greet -sv --name=mini --times=3
HELLO, MINI!
HELLO, MINI!
HELLO, MINI!
(greeted 3 time(s))
$ tool greet --help
usage: tool greet [options]
  -h, --help  show help
  -v, --verbose  more output
  -n, --name <value>  who to greet (default: world)
  -t, --times <value>  repetitions (default: 1)
  -s, --shout  upper case
$ tool count one two three
1 lines, 3 words, 13 chars
$ tool count
error: expected <text>
(exit code 2)
$ tool sum -x 1 -x2 -x 39
sum of 3 numbers = 42
$ tool sum -x abc
error: not a number: abc
(exit code 2)
$ tool greet --times many
error: --times needs a number, got 'many'
(exit code 2)
$ tool greet --bogus
error: unknown option --bogus
(exit code 2)
$ tool frobnicate
error: unknown command 'frobnicate'
(exit code 2)
$ tool count -- --not-an-option -x
1 lines, 2 words, 18 chars
$ tool
error: missing command
(exit code 2)
